    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to bring to the market this two bedroom, two bathroom apartment located in popular development of Rath Geal, Clondalkin. The development itself is located within easy reach of all essential amenities including schools, shops, recreational facilities and is only a short drive to Clondalkin Village. Transport wise commuting is made easy with access to local bus routes, Kishoge train station and N7/M50 road networks.\n\nInternal living accommodation of c. 61 Sq m can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hall, storage cupboard, open plan lounge/dining/kitchen area with large front facing balcony, two double bedrooms with master ensuite and a main family bathroom. Externally this development offers ample parking and communal gardens.\n\nThis property would suit a wide range of people from first time buyers looking to get on the property ladder to keen investors. Due to recent success in the development we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest!\n\nKey Features\n<ul>\n <li>Two bed/ two bath</li>\n <li>Top Floor apartment</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>61 Sqm</li>\n <li>Built in wardrobes</li>\n <li>Large front facing balcony</li>\n <li>Ample storage space</li>\n <li>Short drive to Corkagh Park</li>\n <li>Superb location close to all essential amenities</li>\n <li>Communal parking</li>\n <li>Close to shops, schools and major road networks Viewing is highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\nDirections\nD22AK11"
      },
      {
